# Designing Multimedia Systems for Museum Objects and Their Documentation.

**Authors:** Moline, Judi

## Abstract
Illustrates how hypertext and multimedia can be applied in museums to facilitate humanities research. A model of a museum professional's information needs is presented, the Open System Environment (OSE) is explained as a conceptual framework for user requirements, and the COIN (Catalogued Objects and Information for Numismatists) hypertext system is described. (14 references) (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ444713

